{"4361870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arctic Farmer Life Simulator", "steam_appid": 4361870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Grow in Harsh Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/972717521180b90f6609c5aec833c56b.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/972717521180b90f6609c5aec833c56b.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm in greenhouses or indoor growing rooms, learn new technologies from mainland universities, and upgrade your equipment to improve your farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Raise Poultry for Eggs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/a056a7270b3c546efe26af133e85a4b2.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/a056a7270b3c546efe26af133e85a4b2.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise poultry like quails for eggs and sell them to local supermarkets. Expand your poultry houses to accommodate more types of poultry and increase production efficiency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Do Business with Locals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/1d1f32075a8a7309794963828e705291.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/1d1f32075a8a7309794963828e705291.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply luxury restaurants with freshly grown vegetables, deliver on time, and collect used trays. Build relationships with restaurant owners and collaborate to grow your business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Utilize Arctic Transportation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/58c5e7c6427375d12afcc8562b1c576b.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/58c5e7c6427375d12afcc8562b1c576b.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train huskies and create a sled team, or buy your own snowmobiles for efficient transportation during harsh Arctic winters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5. Expand Beyond Your Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/90a90a0bb99b31b31197404845f4f9b1.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/90a90a0bb99b31b31197404845f4f9b1.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a hangar and your own plane to expand your business to nearby islands and even the mainland.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Grow in Harsh Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/972717521180b90f6609c5aec833c56b.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/972717521180b90f6609c5aec833c56b.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm in greenhouses or indoor growing rooms, learn new technologies from mainland universities, and upgrade your equipment to improve your farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Raise Poultry for Eggs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/a056a7270b3c546efe26af133e85a4b2.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/a056a7270b3c546efe26af133e85a4b2.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise poultry like quails for eggs and sell them to local supermarkets. Expand your poultry houses to accommodate more types of poultry and increase production efficiency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Do Business with Locals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/1d1f32075a8a7309794963828e705291.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/1d1f32075a8a7309794963828e705291.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply luxury restaurants with freshly grown vegetables, deliver on time, and collect used trays. Build relationships with restaurant owners and collaborate to grow your business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Utilize Arctic Transportation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/58c5e7c6427375d12afcc8562b1c576b.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/58c5e7c6427375d12afcc8562b1c576b.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train huskies and create a sled team, or buy your own snowmobiles for efficient transportation during harsh Arctic winters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5. Expand Beyond Your Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras/90a90a0bb99b31b31197404845f4f9b1.avif?t=1787494860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/extras_big/90a90a0bb99b31b31197404845f4f9b1.avif?t=1787494860 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a hangar and your own plane to expand your business to nearby islands and even the mainland.</p>", "short_description": "On a remote Arctic island, fresh produce arrives only by air until you decide to grow your own. Farm in harsh conditions, raise poultry for eggs, and supply local schools, shops, and restaurants. Expand with sleds, snowmobiles, hangars, and new air routes to nearby islands and the mainland.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Hungarian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/57ed0ab2c48c094d77b7fe0fb10283bf18747674/header.jpg?t=1787494860", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/c7ca36092a3e3b71a6258a5f95d949475d1106bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787494860", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361870/c7ca36092a3e3b71a6258a5f95d949475d1106bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787494860", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 19 GB availabl